# Lenovo IdeaPad D330-10IGL Hardware Control udev rules
#
# NOTE: `conservation_mode` and `fn_lock` are platform sysfs attributes owned
# by the `ideapad_laptop` driver. udev cannot chmod sysfs attributes, so a
# MODE/GROUP attribute rule here would be a no-op and has been removed.
# Writing these nodes therefore requires root (or `pkexec <cmd>`); there is no
# non-root plugdev path. Use `d330-ctl` via sudo/pkexec to toggle conservation
# mode and fn-lock.
